    "rendered_text": "<|psion_user|> Why checkpoint a fine-tune run? <|psion_end|> <|psion_assistant|> A checkpoint lets an interrupted run resume from saved optimizer and parameter state instead of restarting from scratch. <|psion_end|> <|psion_user|> And what must the checkpoint include? <|psion_end|> <|psion_assistant|> Parameters, optimizer moments, scheduler state, and the completed step count. <|psion_end|> <|psion_eos|>",
